SUMMARY:NY: IT-204-LL filing fee due for calendar-year LLCs with New York
  income
DESCRIPTION:Due the 15th day of the third month after the tax year ends. 
 $25 for a single-member LLC with New York-source income\; $25 to $4\,500 
 for LLCs taxed as partnerships.\n\nDetails: https://mfa-advisory.com/blog
 /llc-tax-advantages-explained/\nGeneral information\, not tax advice. Mer
 chant Financial Advisory\, mfa-advisory.com
